  "description": "Containers, metadata, subtitles; no decoding. Reads containers and writes MP4/MOV/fMP4/CMAF, Matroska/WebM, MPEG-TS/M2TS and WAV/BWF/RF64, edits tags, remuxes, trims and makes files playable, strips location and device identifiers, writes capture dates, repairs damaged files and rebuilds cut-off recordings, packages HLS and DASH, reads HLS/DASH presentations and growing files, and covers subtitles and captions, capture facts, telemetry and timed events. A managed media container library with no dependency beyond .NET: sources, exact media time, limits, typed defects, content sniffing and the track and packet model that the format readers build on. Unaffiliated with other products or companies named OneMedia.",
